[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0010","text":"『借你的漫画，明天带过去可以吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0020","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0030","text":"咦？　凛世酱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0040","text":"『您是不是发错收件人了？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0050","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0060","text":"啊──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0080","text":"『对不起！\n　本来要发给班上的同学的，结果发错了！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0090","text":"『谢谢你……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0100","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0110","text":"『太好了。』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0120","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0130","text":"喂……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0140","text":"『对不起……！\n　一着急就操作失误了……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0150","text":"不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0160","text":"能听到……\n智代子小姐的声音了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0170","text":"『……！　好、好温柔……！\n　而且这句话好让人心动……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0180","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0190","text":"『──那，真的对不起啦……！\n　帮大忙了，晚安……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0200","text":"好的……\n晚安……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0202","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_05_0201","text":"Motion"}]
